01:00:22.137 --> 01:00:23.089
- Right, right.

01:00:23.089 --> 01:00:25.109
- Fan culture in Japan is like next level.

01:00:25.109 --> 01:00:25.942
- Yeah.

01:00:25.942 --> 01:00:27.277
- Take it to like the limit.

01:00:27.277 --> 01:00:28.110
- Yeah.

01:00:28.110 --> 01:00:29.935
Or what is a Takarazuka theater?

01:00:29.935 --> 01:00:31.555
- Takarazuka is like, it's this basically

01:00:31.555 --> 01:00:33.176
this like very trad,

01:00:33.176 --> 01:00:34.957
I don't know a whole lot about it myself,

01:00:34.957 --> 01:00:37.216
