just sweating there also.

01:04:41.356 --> 01:04:42.189
- Yeah.

01:04:42.189 --> 01:04:44.577
- The struggles of being from
like this part of the world.

01:04:44.577 --> 01:04:46.665
Any weather is like, what the fuck?

01:04:46.665 --> 01:04:47.606
