You like, you can get
away with much less choice

01:05:32.590 --> 01:05:35.130
into the UK compared to what
you do in Japan, you know?

01:05:35.130 --> 01:05:35.963
- Yeah, definitely.

01:05:35.963 --> 01:05:36.796
Definitely.

01:05:36.796 --> 01:05:38.680
